# Intentionally empty of rules. Not the active CODEOWNERS.
#
# When CODEOWNERS exists in more than one location, GitHub uses only the first
# it finds, searching .github/ -> root -> docs/. This repository has one at
# .github/CODEOWNERS, so every rule written here is silently ignored.
#
# That is a quiet trap: edits here look correct, get reviewed, merge, and
# protect nothing. This file is left in place as a signpost rather than deleted,
# so anyone who goes looking for CODEOWNERS at the root is sent to the real one
# instead of finding nothing and creating a second set of rules.
#
# The active rules live in:
#
#     .github/CODEOWNERS
